      "text color": "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
      "content": "When asked about how often social media content was inciting violence towards ethnic minorities, 46% of respondents had “sometimes” seen this type of extremist social media content inciting violence towards ethnic minorities whereas only 27% have seen this content rarely or never. Women have seen such content more frequently than men (90%), and Indonesia was the country from which most"
